01:21:12.900 --> 01:21:15.520
And they pushed them.

01:21:18.180 --> 01:21:21.400
And they wanted to break the door.

01:21:23.020 --> 01:21:24.760
Now these angels were anxious.

01:21:24.760 --> 01:21:28.160
And they stretched their arms

01:21:28.160 --> 01:21:32.240
and they breathed blood to the house.

01:21:33.100 --> 01:21:34.360
And then they said something like this.

01:21:34.360 --> 01:21:36.440
They have some like those gas, keel gas.

01:21:38.380 --> 01:21:39.140
Yes, you want to see?

01:21:39.680 --> 01:21:39.920
Alright.

01:21:40.940 --> 01:21:41.920
By the time the people of the house

01:21:41.920 --> 01:21:43.300
came in, they were not at home.

01:21:43.540 --> 01:21:44.220
They were at the door.

01:21:46.140 --> 01:21:47.820
And the people of the house

01:21:47.820 --> 01:21:48.800
they put their things in.

01:21:49.020 --> 01:21:49.840
They made them blind.

01:21:50.140 --> 01:21:51.680
They put something that made them blind.

01:21:53.040 --> 01:21:53.440
What?

01:21:54.540 --> 01:21:55.340
Made them smoke pot.

01:21:55.520 --> 01:21:55.880
I don't know.

01:21:56.100 --> 01:21:57.040
This is written there.

01:21:57.120 --> 01:21:57.360
What it says.

01:21:57.440 --> 01:21:58.300
They put their things in.

01:22:00.240 --> 01:22:01.220
Mikaton be'akalon.

01:22:01.420 --> 01:22:02.340
And nobody was able to see.

01:22:02.340 --> 01:22:05.120
by cooling some of the particles

01:22:05.120 --> 01:22:06.620
and they were unable to see.

01:22:08.640 --> 01:22:09.540
And then,

01:22:09.820 --> 01:22:10.620
I think it's

01:22:10.620 --> 01:22:11.940
the next little step.

01:22:13.100 --> 01:22:14.320
There's an explosion.

01:22:15.400 --> 01:22:17.240
The scientists who studied

01:22:17.240 --> 01:22:19.420
this book of

01:22:19.420 --> 01:22:21.160
this penashah, they said

01:22:21.160 --> 01:22:23.660
the explosion is exactly like an atomic explosion.

01:22:24.400 --> 01:22:25.540
This is an atomic explosion.

01:22:26.580 --> 01:22:27.260
By the way, scientists

01:22:27.260 --> 01:22:29.360
who investigated the geology

01:22:29.360 --> 01:22:31.100
of the Nubah Amra, they said

01:22:31.100 --> 01:22:39.100
the only way to explain it is an atomic explosion. There is still reverence of an atomic explosion, and it seems to be a miracle.

01:22:39.100 --> 01:22:42.100
But the miracle is an atomic explosion.

01:22:42.100 --> 01:22:49.100
As far as I'm going to look at it, I said before we leave, I want to tell you we have Salah every day at 7 o'clock in the morning,

01:22:49.100 --> 01:22:55.100
because it's going to come. Sundays is at 8 o'clock in the morning. This Tuesday we have an explosion in Knesset, and we put out the Quran.

01:22:55.100 --> 01:22:59.100
the captain of this district is a Jew, and he's...

01:22:59.100 --> 01:23:01.100
No, this Jew!

01:23:01.100 --> 01:23:04.100
Oh, that's the student, the parliament student, alright.

01:23:04.100 --> 01:23:07.100
The parliament student, the captain of this district is a Jew,

01:23:07.100 --> 01:23:09.100
and he wants to talk about class.

01:23:09.100 --> 01:23:12.100
He wants to talk about the police captain, so I think I would like you to come here,

01:23:12.100 --> 01:23:15.100
and to meet him personally, and we'll answer him, why don't we go to class.

01:23:15.100 --> 01:23:18.100
So, we have a full program,

01:23:18.100 --> 01:23:19.100
and Rabbi Hayan,

01:23:19.100 --> 01:23:21.100
Shalom.

